@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@email = test@hovr.test
@password = test-pass-123

### Health check (no auth)
GET http://localhost:8080/healthz

### 1. Sign up — sends a confirmation email to Mailpit
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Sign in before confirming — expect 403 "Confirm your email first"
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signin
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. Confirm the email
# Open the email in Mailpit and copy the link. It goes to Supabase, which redirects
# to APP_URL/api/auth/callback?code=... . Without the frontend running, change the
# host in that redirect from localhost:3000 to localhost:8080 and paste the code here.
# Must run in the same client as step 1 (it needs the hovr_pkce cookie).
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/callback?code=PASTE_CODE_HERE&next=/onboarding

### 4. Sign in — sets the session cookies
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signin
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 5. Who am I — expect 200 with id, email, plan
GET {{baseUrl}}/me

### 6. Wrong password — expect 401 "Wrong email or password."
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signin
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### 7. Request from another site — expect 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signin
Origin: https://evil.example
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 8. Change password (needs a session) — expect 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "new-pass-456"
}

### 9. Forgot password — always 200; the reset email goes to Mailpit.
# Its link ends in the same callback as step 3, with next=/reset-password.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/recover
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### 10. Sign out — expect 204, cookies cleared
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signout
Origin: {{origin}}

### 11. Who am I after sign-out — expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
